+// CNTFRQ_EL0 reads 0 on this platform - the timer libraries carry
+// PcdTimerFreqOverwrite for exactly that - so a count of seconds is not
+// something this code can compute, and a hold that is too long only holds the
+// screen longer. The loop stays bounded, so control still reaches the assert
+// that follows and the boot still ends; it ends minutes later.
