+  // and its cost is at least a cycle and more likely a handful - so this is a
+  // few seconds a copy, and the 40 copies are a minute or more. The bound is
+  // what matters rather than the figure: even at one cycle an iteration, which
+  // is faster than the loop can run, 40 copies still outlast the twelve seconds
+  // they replace.
+  Hold = 2000000000ULL;
